---
title: Part IV - quote to policy application sequence
---
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Agent as Agent / Customer
    participant Web as Flask route
    participant QS as quote_service
    participant PS as policy_service
    participant RC as regional_context_service
    participant ORM as SQLAlchemy session
    participant DB as PostgreSQL 16

    Agent->>Web: POST /quotes/new
    Web->>QS: create_quote(...)
    QS->>ORM: add QUOTE + QUOTE_STATUS_HISTORY
    ORM->>DB: BEGIN / INSERT x2 / COMMIT
    Note over ORM,DB: One transaction.<br/>A quote without its opening<br/>history row cannot exist.
    DB-->>Agent: Quote Q4-... created as Draft

    Agent->>Web: POST /quotes/{id}/coverage
    Web->>QS: add_coverage(...)
    QS->>ORM: INSERT QUOTE_COVERAGE
    QS->>ORM: UPDATE QUOTE.EstimatedPremium
    Note over QS: Demonstration rule:<br/>limit and deductible only.<br/>No ML or health input.
    ORM->>DB: COMMIT

    Agent->>Web: POST /quotes/{id}/transition
    Web->>QS: transition(Submitted / Rated / Presented)
    QS->>DB: SELECT ... FOR UPDATE
    QS->>ORM: UPDATE QUOTE + INSERT history
    ORM->>DB: COMMIT

    Agent->>Web: GET /quotes/{id}
    Web->>RC: account_context(account, active run)
    RC->>DB: SELECT from MV_ACCOUNT_REGIONAL_HEALTH_PROFILE
    RC->>DB: SELECT approved mappings (reviewed AND active)
    RC-->>Web: aggregate indicators + approved themes
    Web-->>Agent: "Research context - not a rating input"

    Agent->>Web: POST /quotes/{id}/payment
    Web->>QS: authorize_payment(...)
    QS->>ORM: INSERT PAYMENT_AUTHORIZATION
    Note over QS,DB: Authorisation reference only.<br/>No cardholder data.
    ORM->>DB: COMMIT

    Agent->>Web: POST /quotes/{id}/transition (Accepted)
    Web->>QS: transition(Accepted)
    QS-->>Web: rejected unless payment is authorized

    Agent->>Web: POST /quotes/{id}/issue
    Web->>PS: issue_policy(...)
    PS->>DB: SELECT quote FOR UPDATE
    PS->>DB: check QUOTE_CONVERSION
    PS->>ORM: INSERT CONTRACT
    PS->>ORM: INSERT CONTRACT_BENEFIT (per coverage)
    PS->>ORM: INSERT CONTRACT_PREMIUM (per benefit)
    PS->>ORM: INSERT QUOTE_CONVERSION
    PS->>ORM: UPDATE QUOTE = Converted + history
    ORM->>DB: COMMIT
    Note over PS,DB: All six writes commit together.<br/>UNIQUE(QuoteID) rejects a<br/>second conversion under any race.
    DB-->>Agent: Policy POL-... issued
